airgap-agent is an independent project. It is *architecturally inspired*
by Hermes Agent (https://github.com/nousresearch/hermes-agent, MIT
licensed, (c) Nous Research), but it is not affiliated with, endorsed by,
or derived from the Hermes Agent source code. No Hermes Agent source
code, icons, logos, favicons, or other assets are included in this
repository.

Where airgap-agent borrows ideas (the shape of an agent loop, a toolset
abstraction, local session state), those ideas are reimplemented from
scratch with a deliberately opposite goal: airgap-agent is designed to be
incapable of network egress. See README.md and SECURITY.md.

The names "Hermes", "Hermes Agent", and "Nous Research", and any
